Third-party software and weights in the built images (not part of this repository, not covered above)

- ComfyUI (https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI), GPL-3.0. Installed unmodified at a pinned
  commit as a separate program; the handler talks to it only over its local HTTP and websocket API.
- Python packages listed in gpu/requirements.txt, each under its own license.
- Model weights listed in gpu/models.json (main image) and gpu/models.lab.json (Lab image), each under
  the license recorded there. The Lab image's models are research or non-commercial licenses; see
  gpu/README.md.
